---
comment: "시스템 알림 - MAX_HP"
type: editdisplay
ableFlag: true
flag: g<cbs>
---
@@@ IN
\[SYSTEM\|MAX_HP:([+\-]?\d+)\s*(.*?)\]
@@@ OUT
{{#if {{greater_equal::{{chat_index}}::{{? {{lastmessageid}}-5}}}}}}<div class="sys-alert sys-alert-hp"><div class="sys-alert-icon">💪</div><div class="sys-alert-body"><span class="sys-alert-tag">MAX HP</span><span class="sys-alert-value sys-positive">$1</span><div class="sys-alert-desc">$2</div></div></div>{{/if}}
